  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 4b92691faec7c95e2b99a1e9aebad607, type: 3}
  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 0.4509804, g: 0.30980393, b: 0.27058825, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 0
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_FontData:
    m_Font: {fileID: 12800000, guid: cc6284d09f458b845b1fde322281907e, type: 3}
    m_FontSize: 22
    m_FontStyle: 0
    m_BestFit: 0
    m_MinSize: 2
    m_MaxSize: 40
    m_Alignment: 0
    m_AlignByGeometry: 0
    m_RichText: 1
    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1.1
  m_Text: "当目标王国剩余可迁入的领主数不为0时，满足以下条件的领主可通过移民迁入该王国。\n1.未超出移民实力限制。\n2.大熔炉等级达20级及以上。\n3.城镇不处于战斗状态，没有部队出征在外。\n4.未加入任何联盟。\n5.不是任何王国的执政官。\n6.军医所无伤兵，募兵所无预备兵。\n7.距离上次移民已达到30天。\n8.在目标王国拥有的角色数量少于4个。\n注：特殊移民不计入移民领主数，且不受王国移民实力限制"
  m_PointerTween: 0
  m_TweenScale: {x: 1.2, y: 1.2}
  m_isMaxWidth: 0
  m_maxWidth: 0
  colorType: 0
  m_isStatic: 1
